    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>The Lamp block displays a colored indicator whose color depends on the value of the bound signal. Value-to-color mappings define the state colors; other values use the default color.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no input ports.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Output(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no output ports.</p>
    <p>
